ithub.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iviapps/Orderflow_Project_2025/commits/ce9b2dd7f4d20138dbd3c658276924dbfe507de9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-20T17:31:16Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-20T17:31:16Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(apphost): inject dynamic frontend URL into Identity for OAuth callback\n\nAspire assigns a dynamic port to the frontend via WithHttpEndpoint(env: \"VITE_PORT\"),\nso the Vite dev server never runs on the hardcoded localhost:5173 that Identity used\nfor the post-OAuth browser redirect.\n\nAfter frontendApp is defined, inject the actual Aspire-assigned endpoint URL into\nthe Identity service using the same WithEnvironment/GetEndpoint pattern already used\nfor VITE_API_GATEWAY_URL. The double-underscore notation (Frontend__Url) maps to the\nexisting Frontend:Url configuration key, requiring no changes to AuthController.\n\nIn production, override via the Frontend__Url environment variable.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01Mms2LqtGBrrKczDuRuCm51","tree":{"sha":"fd89195cd307985234b3d50416214984627f0e38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iviapps/Orderflow_Project_2025/git/trees/fd89195cd307985234b3d50416214984627f0e38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iviapps/Orderflow_Project_2025/git/commits/ce9b2dd7f4d20138dbd3c658276924dbfe507de9","verification":{"payload":"tree fd89195cd307985234b3d50416214984627f0e38\nparent b1fdf2a4b4a95aa28537a179c14473933f14418f\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1771608676 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1771608676 +0000\n\nfix(apphost): inject dynamic frontend URL into Identity for OAuth callback\n\nAspire assigns a dynamic port to the frontend via WithHttpEndpoint(env: \"VITE_PORT\"),\nso the Vite dev server never runs on the hardcoded localhost:5173 that Identity used\nfor the post-OAuth browser redirect.\n\nAfter frontendApp is defined, inject the actual Aspire-assigned endpoint URL into\nthe Identity service using the same WithEnvironment/GetEndpoint pattern already used\nfor VITE_API_GATEWAY_URL. The double-underscore notation (Frontend__Url) maps to the\nexisting Frontend:Url configuration key, requiring no changes to AuthController.\n\nIn production, override via the Frontend__Url environment variable.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01Mms2LqtGBrrKczDuRuCm51\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQItQvzzX\nk2j7XdxR5EHNjOIHJn4bupylwX5hb1sLTN5YAY1yWzbK4ZQWAvr+EZvQx5xsp1BoXyKqyvjl05Fz\nUQA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-02-20T17:31:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_even