n":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iviapps/Orderflow_Project_2025/commits/31f29e24e63dc9e62ce4b72a03f1f5f2c76b5578/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-20T16:14:25Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-20T16:14:25Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(identity): add UseForwardedHeaders to fix Google OAuth redirect_uri_mismatch\n\nThe Identity service runs behind the YARP API Gateway. When the Google OAuth\nmiddleware builds the redirect_uri to send to Google it uses Request.Host,\nwhich without UseForwardedHeaders resolves to the internal Aspire host instead\nof the public gateway address (localhost:7182).\n\nAdding UseForwardedHeaders (with KnownNetworks/KnownProxies cleared to trust\nthe Aspire gateway) makes Request.Host reflect the X-Forwarded-Host value\ninjected by YARP, so the generated redirect_uri matches the registered\nhttps://localhost:7182/signin-google entry in Google Console.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01Aetu8kccjfqJ82JjMSTSRL","tree":{"sha":"c7fbb1088c7ede5f607f285f0c23b7ccc045e594","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iviapps/Orderflow_Project_2025/git/trees/c7fbb1088c7ede5f607f285f0c23b7ccc045e594"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iviapps/Orderflow_Project_2025/git/commits/31f29e24e63dc9e62ce4b72a03f1f5f2c76b5578","verification":{"payload":"tree c7fbb1088c7ede5f607f285f0c23b7ccc045e594\nparent 664282f57bbd545e88a1f1291ee2b6014d9a3648\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1771604065 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1771604065 +0000\n\nfix(identity): add UseForwardedHeaders to fix Google OAuth redirect_uri_mismatch\n\nThe Identity service runs behind the YARP API Gateway. When the Google OAuth\nmiddleware builds the redirect_uri to send to Google it uses Request.Host,\nwhich without UseForwardedHeaders resolves to the internal Aspire host instead\nof the public gateway address (localhost:7182).\n\nAdding UseForwardedHeaders (with KnownNetworks/KnownProxies cleared to trust\nthe Aspire gateway) makes Request.Host reflect the X-Forwarded-Host value\ninjected by YARP, so the generated redirect_uri matches the registered\nhttps://localhost:7182/signin-google entry in Google Console.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01Aetu8kccjfqJ82JjMSTSRL\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLphw4pf\nkeXA9mAvdAqh0Fivh/GKo7HhyVyNKFzW1UmT2Iv2+yEjfBr74ecZ8WoK7GAFTk+xcY0gsL6brbDR\nugk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-02-20T16:14:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/us