ch migration\n\nThe API Gateway uses YARP for reverse proxy and service discovery is\ncase-sensitive. All service names must be lowercase and consistent\nbetween AppHost registration and yarp.json routes.\n\nThe PendingModelChangesWarning occurred because the migration had\nMaxLength constraints but the model didn''t have matching attributes.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01Xx8UUmVTDm4grZK6uf7BGq","tree":{"sha":"f9e0a354b51170cfb90aeb46295ba3d1607ca2c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iviapps/Orderflow_Project_2025/git/trees/f9e0a354b51170cfb90aeb46295ba3d1607ca2c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iviapps/Orderflow_Project_2025/git/commits/61ab60a7dfe7da1bfc9abd345ae06bcddef0adab","verification":{"payload":"tree f9e0a354b51170cfb90aeb46295ba3d1607ca2c4\nparent 17cdeb612c3d6ad3288f78a9cefa9d685dd7a967\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1770085919 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1770085919 +0000\n\nFix API Gateway routing and migration warnings\n\nChanges:\n- Fix service name casing in AppHost.cs for service discovery:\n  - Orderflow-notifications → orderflow-notifications\n  - Orderflow-orders → orderflow-orders\n  - Orderflow-web → orderflow-web\n- Fix frontend project path casing (Orderflow.web → Orderflow.Web)\n- Add [MaxLength] annotations to ApplicationUser.cs to match migration\n\nThe API Gateway uses YARP for reverse proxy and service discovery is\ncase-sensitive. All service names must be lowercase and consistent\nbetween AppHost registration and yarp.json routes.\n\nThe PendingModelChangesWarning occurred because the migration had\nMaxLength constraints but the model didn''t have matching attributes.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01Xx8UUmVTDm4grZK6uf7BGq\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOz4ZJqV\n5JGk0GAraXnSCzfB1szweE6gRCrVRpnlirF0VX4xMDTLEaqTrCRn