969b5657f1c242c7507d84834e9226","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iviapps/Orderflow_Project_2025/commits/42d188b683969b5657f1c242c7507d84834e9226"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iviapps/Orderflow_Project_2025/commits/5995e54ab4eb58e9b2cffa4c42caacdb951f345d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-16T10:02:44Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-16T10:02:44Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat: Add comprehensive README, complete frontend features, and increase test coverage\n\n## README Improvements\n- Complete restructuring with clear separation of Backend and Frontend sections\n- Detailed documentation of all microservices (Identity, Catalog, Orders, Notifications)\n- API Gateway routing documentation with examples\n- Frontend architecture and communication flow diagrams\n- Installation instructions for both Aspire and manual setup\n- Added stack technology tables and configuration guides\n\n## Frontend Enhancements\n- Created RegisterPage with full form validation\n- Enhanced LoginPage with JWT token management\n- Added OrdersPage to display user orders with filtering and status badges\n- Created ProfilePage for user profile management\n- Implemented AdminUsersPage with pagination and search functionality\n- Updated AppLayout with conditional navigation based on auth state\n- Added all new routes to router configuration\n\n## Testing Improvements\n- Added tests for GetCurrentUserProfileAsync method\n- Improved test coverage for AdminUser operations\n- All tests follow existing patterns with proper mocking\n\n## API Gateway\n- All routes documented in README\n- Clear examples of frontend-to-backend communication\n- CORS and authentication flow documented\n\nThese changes provide a complete foundation for the OrderFlow e-commerce platform with\na professional README, functional frontend pages, and comprehensive test coverage.","tree":{"sha":"e40e92d4f6eeaafcfa164c85df1520b336865218","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iviapps/Orderflow_Project_2025/git/trees/e40e92d4f6eeaafcfa164c85df1520b336865218"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iviapps/Orderflow_Project_2025/git/commits/5995e54ab4eb58e9b2cffa4c42caacdb951f345d","verification":{"payload":"tree e40e92d4f6eeaafcfa164c85df1520b336865218\nparent 972d2094ff1e0ba6fd86c618e0022224a410aa07\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1765879364 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1765879364 +0000\n\nfeat: Add comprehensive README, complete frontend features, and increase test coverage\n\n## README Improvements\n- Complete restructuring with clear separation of Backend and Frontend sections\n- Detailed documentation of all microservices (Identity, Catalog, Orders, Notifications)\n- API Gateway routing documentation with examples\n- Frontend architecture and communication flow diagrams\n- Installation instructions for both Aspire and manual setup\n- Added stack technology tables and configuration guides\n\n## Frontend Enhancements\n- Created RegisterPage with full form 