nted a comprehensive plugin-based architecture for React applications with:\n\nArchitecture:\n- Host shell application managing plugin lifecycle\n- Module Federation for dynamic plugin loading\n- Event Bus for loose coupling between plugins\n- Zustand for state management\n- React Query for data fetching\n\nComponents:\n- Host application with plugin loader and core services\n- Shared packages (types, UI components)\n- Three example plugins (Dashboard, Analytics, Settings)\n\nFeatures:\n- Independent build and deployment of plugins\n- Runtime plugin loading from remote URLs\n- Event-driven communication\n- Shared singleton dependencies\n- Permission system\n- TypeScript support throughout\n\nTech Stack:\n- React 18 with TypeScript\n- Vite with Module Federation plugin\n- Zustand for state management\n- React Query for data fetching\n- Tailwind CSS for styling\n- pnpm workspaces for monorepo\n\nDocumentation:\n- Comprehensive README with setup instructions\n- Architecture documentation\n- Contributing guidelines\n- MIT License","tree":{"sha":"ceb926c2ade9f89e90e6d30f99fc623266253f10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/akhilshastri/react-plugin-ui/git/trees/ceb926c2ade9f89e90e6d30f99fc623266253f10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/akhilshastri/react-plugin-ui/git/commits/1b860f48ac312539795057a3d8f915acaf4a9004","verification":{"payload":"tree ceb926c2ade9f89e90e6d30f99fc623266253f10\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1764736046 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1764736046 +0000\n\nfeat: implement plugin-based architecture with Module Federation\n\nImplemented a comprehensive plugin-based architecture for React applications with:\n\nArchitecture:\n- Host shell application managing plugin lifecycle\n- Module Federation for dynamic plugin loading\n- Event Bus for loose coupling between plugins\n- Zustand for state management\n- React Query for data fetching\n\nComponents:\n- Host application with plugin loader and core services\n- Shared packages (types, UI components)\n- Three example plugins (Dashboard, Analytics, Settings)\n\nFeatures:\n- Independent build and deployment of plugins\n- Runtime plugin loading from remote URLs\n- Event-driven communication\n- Shared singleton dependencies\n- Permission system\n- TypeScript support throughout\n\nTech Stack:\n- React 18 with TypeScript\n- Vite with Module Federation plugin\n- Zustand for state management\n- React Query for data fetching\n- Tailwind CSS for styling\n- pnpm workspaces for monorepo\n\nDocumentation:\n- Comprehensive README with setup instructions\n- Architecture documentation\n- Contributing guidelines\n- MIT License\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMp/+Pmg\nJRAvM7Yv0Q6Lr/m/AQ4HZNwjBEHpDfS+9dPXtEHnGEq2Ao3DmX2V8UjocEP/BdjlwlDsgDsby+2C\nrAM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-12-03T04:27:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/akhilshastri/react-plugi