/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_colourful_tab_extension/commits/137e10aa3e29e32c89fce6f824c556706de88710/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T11:18:10Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T11:18:10Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"message":"feat: dynamic divider between same-coloured tabs + settings palette editor\n\n- adjacent tabs sharing a colour keep a visible seam: the theme''s 1px\n  divider stroke is recoloured with a runtime-computed grey at >=4:1\n  contrast against both the inactive and active shade - darker than the\n  tabs in the light theme, brighter in the dark theme; both seam borders\n  are set because the selected tab''s left border wins the seam\n- palette editor in the Settings Editor: inactive and active shade per\n  colour name for both themes; edits regenerate the injected style so\n  tabs, toolbar, swatches and divider greys follow live\n- dynamicDivider setting toggles the divider (default on)\n- invalid user settings fall back to the default palette with the\n  divider still active instead of silently disabling the feature\n- yarn.lock gains the new @jupyterlab/settingregistry and ajv entries\n  so CI''s immutable install resolves against the committed lock","tree":{"sha":"245313479a197ec36a0892253885858bd81054a8","url":"