tellarshenson"},"message":"style: darken dark-theme active tab shades\n\nFollow-up to the 1.1.11 base-colour darkening: the active (selected)\nshades get the same ~13% treatment (e.g. rose #43282e -> #3a2328), so\nthe selected tab keeps its familiar darker-than-siblings contrast\nagainst the newly darkened inactive tabs.","tree":{"sha":"a445883caf6f9987ebc778ba5fcdf142157ad40e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_colourful_tab_extension/git/trees/a445883caf6f9987ebc778ba5fcdf142157ad40e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_colourful_tab_extension/git/commits/664471212dbd22f393ddba79a8e449f01a9ca3c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_colourful_tab_extension/commit/664471212dbd22f393ddba79a8e449f01a9ca3c4","node_id":"C_kwDOQhGsqtoAKDY2NDQ3MTIxMmRiZDIyZjM5M2RkYmE3OWE4ZTQ0OWYwMWE5Y2EzYzQ","par