ser}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_colourful_tab_extension/commits/9411c89de2cdb5283fba1d18780d02623960635b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T08:08:53Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T08:08:53Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"message":"fix: stop API and menu colours fighting over the same tab (DEF-5)\n\nAn API-tinted tab flickered between two colours: the API colour renders\nfrom title.className on every Lumino re-render, while refreshAllTabColours\nre-applied the localStorage menu map on every mutation, stripping all\ncolour classes (the API''s included) before painting its own. The second\ncolour usually came from a stale map entry - terminal stable ids are\nreused session names, so a menu colour set on a long-closed terminal\nattached to new terminals the user never coloured.\n\nTwo changes:\n- refreshAllTabColours paints a stored menu colour only onto a tab with\n  no colour class at all - it never overwrites a live colour\n- a non-null API setColour takes ownership: releaseMenuColour deletes\n  the stored menu entry for that widget''s tab and persists, so the stale\n  colour cannot resurface when the API colour 