wers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_colourful_tab_extension/commits/82aeae6b2667b1e43bfac6f2bc102e927629e6da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T07:26:20Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T07:26:20Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"message":"fix: stop colour bleeding onto other panels in split layouts (DEF-4)\n\napplyToolbarColour assumed a single-panel layout: it sourced the colour\nfrom the first .lm-mod-current tab in document order and painted the\nfirst visible jp-toolbar, so in split layouts the tab and the toolbar\ncould belong to different widgets. API-tinted terminals (claude_code)\nwere the worst case - terminals have no jp-toolbar, so their colour\nalways landed on another panel''s toolbar.\n\nPair per panel instead: each current tab''s colour (read from its live\nclass list) is applied only to the toolbar inside its own widget node,\nmatched via the shared widget id (tab data-id = widget node id).\nWidgets without a toolbar colour nothing.","tree":{"sha":"578d966a6cdcdb73931a76de8adf968596c28003","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_colourful_tab_extension/git/trees/578d966a6cdcdb73931a76de8adf968596c28003"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_colourful_tab_extension/git/commits/82aeae6b2667b1e43bfac6f2bc102e927629e6da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_colourful_tab_extension/commit/82aeae6b2667b1e43bfac6f2bc102e927629e6da","node_id":"C_kwDOQhGsqtoAKDgyYWVhZTZiMjY2N2IxZTQzYmZhYzZmMmJjMTAyZTkyNzYyOWU2ZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_colourful_tab_extension/commit/3aadf0740cd1600e39ab3823fe6b65f823ba63f6","sha":"3aadf0740cd1600e39ab3823fe6b65f823ba63f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_colourful_tab_extension/commits/3aadf0740cd1600e39ab3823fe6b65f823ba63f6"}],"sha":"82aeae6b2667b1e43bfa