c203a30e4208e119f1dba1cbfd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_colourful_tab_extension/commits/567a53cca6b751c203a30e4208e119f1dba1cbfd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_colourful_tab_extension/commits/9a62efbdf82c61f132c98cc5b1e6ba687dd72afb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T11:15:07Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T11:15:07Z","email":"konrad.jelen@gmail.com","name":"stellarshenson"},"message":"fix: preserve the current-tab accent when tinting a tab (DEF-1)\n\nThe public setColour API overwrote widget.title.className wholesale, but the JupyterLab shell stores the selected-tab accent as jp-mod-current on that same property. A consumer re-tinting a tab on each title update destroyed jp-mod-current, so Lumino''s next render dropped the blue accent bar - visible only on coloured tabs. setWidgetTabColour now tokenises 