d src/tokens.ts with IColourfulTabs token and setColour(widget, colourId)\n- provide the token from the plugin; tint via widget.title.className so it\n  rides Lumino tab re-renders without DOM querying\n- keep it additive: right-click menu, localStorage persistence, and mutation\n  observer are unchanged\n- add @lumino/coreutils dependency and sharedPackages federation singleton so\n  the token resolves to a single runtime instance across extensions\n- document the API in README, bump to 1.0.19","tree":{"sha":"75193364a5f4639156f0a5f23da0c0d1ac17b4c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_colourful_tab_extension/git/trees/75193364a5f4639156f0a5f23da0c0d1ac17b4c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stellarshenson/jupyterlab_colourful_tab_extension/git/commits/2c28e17aede2030d2c09d6a0ccf712b29d7c6522","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18424023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stellarshenson","id":18424023,"login":"stellarshenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDI0MDIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stellarshenson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stellars