","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.teltonika/commits/1885d72ab4ec886f86b87a1712253545ebc81913/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T15:00:56Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T15:00:56Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"chore: release v1.0.0\n\n* (bluefox) Added SNMP support for devices without an MQTT publisher, such as the TSW switches\n* (bluefox) Added a network scan that finds Teltonika devices and fills the device table\n* (bluefox) Split the configuration into an MQTT and an SNMP tab\n* (bluefox) Added optional SNMP branches for GPS, Wi-Fi and hotspot sessions, switched off by default\n* (bluefox) Removed the router type setting, which was never evaluated\n* (bluefox) Split the modem address: `wan` keeps the IPv4 address, `wanIPv6` is added where the device has one\n* (bluefox) Added an SNMP trap receiver that records notifications and polls the device that sent one\n* (bluefox) Community strings and SNMPv3 keys are now stored encrypted\n* (bluefox) Ports can be switched through `ports.<name>.enabled` when a write community is configured\n* (bluefox) Added two device manager widgets: an overview of all devices and a front panel view of the ports\n* (bluefox) `info.connection` now also lists the devices polled over SNMP, so an instance without MQTT clients\n  no longer appears disconnected\n* (bluefox) Added the WAN interfaces of a router under `interfaces.<name>`: status, enabled and uptime\n* (bluefox) A port state created before a write community was configured now becomes writable instead of\n  staying read-only forever","tree":{"sha":"e5273d23c29b1ea8bfb831ded26961cf5074bd7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.teltonika/git/trees/e5273d23c29b1ea8bfb831ded26961cf5074bd7a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.teltonika/git/commits/1885d72ab4ec886f86b87a1712253545ebc81913","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.teltonika/commit/1885d72ab4ec886f86b87a1712253545ebc81913","node_id":"C_kwDOQhUzKtoAKDE4ODVkNzJhYjRlYzg4NmY4NmI4N2ExNzEyMjUzNTQ1ZWJjODE5MTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.teltonika/commit/2fd6a11395a4debc97fa8626027b824df42fd515","sha":"2fd6a11395a4debc97fa8626027b824df42fd515","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.teltonika/commits/2fd6a11395a4debc97fa8626027b824df42fd515"}],"sha":"1885d72ab4ec886f86b87a1712253545ebc81913","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.teltonika/commits/1885d72ab4ec886f86b87a1712253545ebc81913"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":