oTo12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/commits/85331eec85b37ac3c2a7e303836c5aaefcf598ce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-04T04:53:18Z","email":"baotochi87@gmail.com","name":"ChiBao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-04T04:53:18Z","email":"baotochi87@gmail.com","name":"ChiBao"},"message":"feat(marketing): Implement Marketing & Engagement services cluster\n## Campaign Service\n- Multi-channel campaign management (email, push, SMS, banner, popup)\n- Audience targeting and segmentation\n- Campaign scheduling and automation\n- Performance metrics (sent, opened, clicked, converted)\n- ROI tracking and attribution\n- Personalization support\n- A/B testing integration\n## Coupon Service\n- Multiple coupon types (percentage, fixed amount, free shipping, BOGO)\n- Global and per-user usage limits\n- Minimum order value validation\n- Maximum discount caps\n- Time-based validity windows\n- Product/category-specific restrictions\n- Real-time coupon validation\n- Usage tracking and analytics\n## Flash Sale Service\n- High-concurrency flash sale events (11.11, Black Friday style)\n- Redis-based atomic stock management\n- Time-based sale activation\n- Stock reservation with TTL\n- Per-user purchase limits\n- Real-time stock updates and conversion tracking\n- Countdown timers\n- Optimized for 10,000+ TPS\n## Gamification Service\n- Points earning system (purchase, review, referral, login)\n- Points redemption for rewards\n- User levels based on lifetime points\n- Achievement badge system\n- Reward catalog management\n- Transaction history tracking\n- Leaderboard functionality\nCompletes Marketing & Engagement cluster (4/4 services)\n🎉 ALL SERVICE CLUSTERS COMPLETE! 🎉\n- Logistics & Fulfillment: ✅ 4/4 services\n- Communication: ✅ 3/3 services\n- Intelligence & Analytics: ✅ 4/4 services\n- Marketing & Engagement: ✅ 4/4 services\nTotal: 15 new services implemented with full DDD architecture","tree":{"sha":"13ee04eb46dbc5542eaa94ba0cf561444bbe5b65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/git/trees/13ee04eb46dbc5542eaa94ba0cf561444bbe5b65"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/git/commits/85331eec85b37ac3c2a7e303836c5aaefcf598ce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117547743?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BaoTo12","id":117547743,"login":"BaoTo12","node_id":"U_kgDOBwGi3w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/commit/85331eec85b37ac3c2a7e303836c5aaefcf598ce","node_id":"C_kwDOQiOmTtoAKDg1MzMxZWVjODViMzdhYzNjMmE3ZTMwMzgzNmM1YWFlZmNmNTk4Y2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/commit/55b4435894d1648ab0e802ade899c2ca97ceffc0","sha":"55b4435894d1648ab0e802ade899c2ca97ceffc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/commits/55b4435894d1648ab0e802ade899c2ca97ceffc0"}],"sha":"85331eec85b37ac3c2a7e303836c5aaefcf598ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/commits/85331eec85b37ac3c2a7e303836c5aaefc