rding and aggregation\n- ClickHouse OLAP storage for fast queries\n- Business intelligence dashboards\n- Funnel and cohort analysis\n## A/B Testing Service\n- Experiment management framework\n- Multi-variant testing (A/B/C/D)\n- Consistent hash-based user assignment\n- Traffic splitting configuration\n- Statistical significance tracking\n- Feature flags integration\nCompletes Intelligence & Analytics cluster (4/4 services)","tree":{"sha":"15a68c62cea05e263f6192ff012cca8f44d2f370","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/git/trees/15a68c62cea05e263f6192ff012cca8f44d2f370"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/git/commits/55b4435894d1648ab0e802ade899c2ca97ceffc0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117547743?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BaoTo12","id":117547743,"login":"BaoTo12","node_id":"U_kgDOBwGi3w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/commit/55b4435894d1648ab0e802ade899c2ca97ceffc0","node_id":"C_kwDOQiOmTtoAKDU1YjQ0MzU4OTRkMTY0OGFiMGU4MDJhZGU4OTljMmNhOTdjZWZmYzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/c