ng (infrastructure ready, need gRPC handler generation):\n Order Service - EventStore + CQRS (infrastructure exists)\n Checkout Service - Saga coordinator (domain exists)\n\n MAJOR MILESTONE: Transaction Core Operational!\n\nPlatform Features NOW Working:\n- Add items to cart (Redis)\n- Reserve inventory atomically (Lua)\n- Process payments securely (idempotency)\n- Hold funds in escrow (multi-vendor ready)\n- Issue refunds automatically\n- Track wallet transactions\n\nWhat''s Functional:\n-  End-to-end cart  inventory  payment  wallet flow!\n-  All repositories wired with databases\n-  All services can start and accept gRPC requests\n-  Real infrastructure (PostgreSQL, Redis)\n-  Production patterns (optimistic locking, atomic operations)\n\nThis IS a working e-commerce backend!","tree":{"sha":"2417cce68fe0497e90c352cb683a58ad0cfdc146","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/git/trees/2417cce68fe0497e90c352cb683a58ad0cfdc146"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/git/commits/cfa3e5b072faf5a75193712197f17b7f73d61e67","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117547743?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BaoTo12","id":117547743,"login":"BaoTo12","node_id":"U_kgDOBwGi3w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users