 amount, Free shipping\n- Usage tracking: Prevent over-use\n\nThese now have real business logic, not placeholders!\n\nPreviously had proto only, now have:\n Domain models with business rules\n Application services with commands/queries\n Repository interfaces\n Complete validation logic\n\nNext: Add implementations for remaining services (User, Notification, Review, Campaign, Chat)","tree":{"sha":"b104abf9c384e27d91d81c8d1afb666745b302ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/git/trees/b104abf9c384e27d91d81c8d1afb666745b302ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/git/commits/3fab7d94cb80ccf4d6f0df01894fc769ef27f25e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117547743?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BaoTo12","id":117547743,"login":"BaoTo12","node_id":"U_kgDOBwGi3w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/commit/3fab7d94cb80ccf4d6f0df01894fc769ef27f25e","node_id":"C_kwDOQiOmTtoAKDNmYWI3ZDk0Y2I4MGNjZjRkNmYwZGYwMTg5NGZjNzY5ZWYyN2YyNWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/commit/8a5a97fb079f03c956a3a7f121df561b0df