17. Category Service:\n    - Proto: Create, Get, List, GetCategoryTree\n    - Features: Hierarchical tree structure (parent-child)\n    - Level tracking for breadcrumbs\n    - Product count per category\n    - SEO-friendly slugs\n\n18. Seller Service:\n    - Proto: Register, GetSeller, UpdateStatus, GetStats\n    - Features: KYC verification workflow\n    - Status: Pending  Verified  Active/Suspended\n    - Stats: Products, sales, revenue, ratings\n    - Bank account linking\n\n19. Chat Service:\n    - Proto: SendMessage, GetMessages, GetConversations, MarkAsRead\n    - Features: Text, Image, Video, File, Product links\n    - Read/unread tracking\n    - Conversation pagination\n    - Multi-media support\n\nProgress: 19/30 services (63%)!\n\nNext: Add 1-2 more to hit 20/30 (67%), perfect checkpoint","tree":{"sha":"abfaaff7a6f23702d0020b7517c2a4e7ee027906","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/git/trees/abfaaff7a6f23702d0020b7517c2a4e7ee027906"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/git/commits/8a5a97fb079f03c956a3a7f121df561b0dfc7bf0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117547743?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BaoTo12","id":117547743,"login":"BaoTo12","node_id":"U_kgDOBwGi3w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://ap