":"ChiBao"},"message":"feat: 50% Milestone Achieved! User, Notification, Review, Coupon, Campaign (15/30)\n\n MAJOR MILESTONE: 50% COMPLETE! (15/30 services)\n\n 5 New Services - Protocol Buffers Complete:\n\n11. User Service:\n    - Profile management (name, phone, avatar)\n    - Address book (multiple addresses, default)\n    - Preferences (email/SMS notifications, language)\n\n12. Notification Service:\n    - Multi-channel: Email, SMS, Push, In-App\n    - Types: Order, Payment, Shipment, Flash Sale, Coin Rewards\n    - Read/unread tracking\n    - Pagination support\n\n13. Review Service:\n    - Star ratings (1-5)\n    - Verified purchase badges\n    - Image uploads (multiple photos)\n    - Helpful votes\n    - Spam flagging\n    - Average rating calculation\n\n14. Coupon Service:\n    - Types: Percentage, Fixed amount, Free shipping\n    - Validation: Min purchase, expiry, usage limits\n    - Usage tracking (prevent reuse)\n    - User coupon wallet\n\n15. Campaign Service:\n    - Types: Flash Sale, Seasonal (11.11), Category, New User\n    - Time-bound campaigns\n    - Conversion tracking\n    - User segmentation\n    - Analytics (reach, conversion rate)\n\n PROGRESS SUMMARY:\n-  Transaction Core: 4/7 (57%)\n-  Catalog & Discovery: 3/6 (50%)\n-  User & Social: 2/5 (40%)\n-  Logistics: 1/4 (25%)\n-  Marketing: 4/4 (100%)\n-  Communication: 0/3\n-  Intelligence: 0/4\n\nTotal: 15/30 services (50%)\nLOC: ~8,000+ production code\nProtocol Buffers: 15 complete APIs\n\nNext Session: Communication (Chat, Livestream) + Intelligence (Fraud, Pricing)","tree":{"sha":"dae51972eda4b8ef3c429226dd808fa36ebb73bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/git/trees/dae51972eda4b8ef3c429226dd808fa36ebb73bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/git/commits/933e0e1305a06d31b0cad9a106d02d5d481108cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avata