 Immediate reservation ID\n   - Async order processing via Kafka\n\nProgress: 9/30 services (30%)!\n-  Transaction: 4/7\n-  Logistics: 1/4\n-  User: 1/5\n-  Catalog: 2/6\n-  Marketing: 1/4 (Flash Sale!)\n\nNext: Gamification (Shopee Coins + Games), then maybe pause for checkpoint","tree":{"sha":"d27c3e3ce637db4b3c8c2a331a053a6eae009869","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/git/trees/d27c3e3ce637db4b3c8c2a331a053a6eae009869"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/git/commits/4d01c66c23405db16f579c2a328ba8efa684e588","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117547743?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BaoTo12","id":117547743,"login":"BaoTo12","node_id":"U_kgDOBwGi3w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/commit/4d01c66c23405db16f579c2a328ba8efa684e588","node_id":"C_kwDOQiOmTtoAKDRkMDFjNjZjMjM0MDVkYjE2ZjU3OWMyYTMyOGJhOGVmYTY4NGU1ODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/commit/25219861c018619ca6b7d33c1306df638507ff52","sha":"25219861c018619ca6b7d33c1306df638507ff52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BaoTo12/go-ec