t, bulk updates ready\n- MongoDB repository interface defined\n\n Search Service - COMPLETE:\n- Infrastructure: Elasticsearch repository\n- Features: Full-text search (name^3, description boost)\n- Filtering: Category, price range, min rating\n- Sorting: Relevance score + sold count\n- Proto: Search, Autocomplete, Index, Delete APIs\n\n Session 3 Summary:\n- 3 services fully implemented (Auth, Product, Search)\n- Total: 8/30 services complete (27%)\n- ~5,000 LOC production-ready code\n- Complete transaction + auth + catalog foundation\n\nNext Session 4: Flash Sale, Livestream, Gamification (wow factors!)","tree":{"sha":"975eb6cc3a13bc3329e6c9d2ae02c4f8758a7b68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/git/trees/975eb6cc3a13bc3329e6c9d2ae02c4f8758a7b68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/git/commits/25219861c018619ca6b7d33c1306df638507ff52","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117547743?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BaoTo12","id":117547743,"login":"BaoTo12","node_id":"U_kgDOBwGi3w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/commit/2521986