oken with expiry management\n- Infrastructure: JWT service in pkg/auth (access + refresh tokens)\n- Proto: Register, Login, RefreshToken, Logout, VerifyToken\n- Features: JWT (15min access, 30day refresh), OAuth2 ready, MFA ready\n\n Product Service - COMPLETE:\n- Domain: Product aggregate with multi-variant support\n- Domain: Product status workflow (draft  pending  approved  published)\n- Proto: CRUD + Search API\n- Features: Multi-variant SKU, seller management, review/rating system\n\n Additions:\n- pkg/auth/jwt.go: Shared JWT service for all services\n- Password hashing with bcrypt (DefaultCost)\n- Token blacklist ready (Redis)\n\nProgress: 7/30 services (23%)\n-  Transaction: Order, Payment, Cart, Checkout (4/7)\n-  Logistics: Inventory (1/4)\n-  User: Auth (1/5)\n-  Catalog: Product (1/6)\n\nNext: Complete Auth + Product implementations, then Search Service (Elasticsearch)","tree":{"sha":"c84a35a27a2ba5c20e8b09ebcf9587b26ed858e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/git/trees/c84a35a27a2ba5c20e8b09ebcf9587b26ed858e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/git/commits/37d8139d8b60a1e05c414deb88facae66ed033bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117547743?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BaoTo12","id":117547743,"login":"BaoTo12","node_id":"U_kgDOBwGi3w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaoTo12/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://