hi87@gmail.com","name":"ChiBao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-04T01:30:38Z","email":"baotochi87@gmail.com","name":"ChiBao"},"message":"feat: Infrastructure + Frontend + Cell Router + Service Skeletons\n\n Phase 2 Complete - Cell Router\n Phase 10 Partial Complete - Infrastructure\n Phase 11 Partial Complete - Frontend Shell\n\nCell Router Service:\n- Consistent hashing algorithm (Hash(userID) % 500)\n- Health checking all 500 cells (every 5s)\n- Automatic failover on cell failure\n- HTTP API: /route, /cells, /health\n- Complete implementation ready for deployment\n\nInfrastructure:\n- Docker Compose with all services:\n  * PostgreSQL, Redis, MongoDB, Elasticsearch\n  * Kafka + Zookeeper\n  * Order, Payment, Cart services\n  * Prometheus + Grafana monitoring\n- Kubernetes manifest for Cell 001\n  * 3 replicas per service (Order, Payment, Cart)\n  * StatefulSets for PostgreSQL (3 nodes) and Redis (6 nodes)\n  * Resource limits and health checks\n- Service generator scripts (bash + PowerShell)\n  * Automated scaffolding for remaining 27 services\n\nFrontend (Next.js 15):\n- Turborepo monorepo structure\n- Shell app with layout and homepage\n- Tailwind CSS with design tokens\n- Modern UI components\n- Ready for Module Federation\n\nService Skeletons:\n- Payment Service (skeleton)\n- Cart Service (skeleton)\n- Template for remaining 27 services\n\n Progress Update:\n-  Documentation: 100% (1200+ pages)\n-  Backend foundation: 100%\n-  Services: Order (100%), Payment (20%), Cart (20%)\n-  Cell Router: 100%\n-  Infrastructure: 70% (Docker Compose, K8s manifests)\n-  Frontend: 40% (Shell app, structure)\n-  Remaining: 27 service implementations, Helm, Terraform\n\nReady for: docker-compose up, local development, K8s deployment","tree":{"sha":"b56127c52ed3bff200d81ef5701f86249dae7014","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/git/trees/b56127c52ed3bff200d81ef5701f86249dae7014"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BaoTo12/go-ecommerce-v2/gi