1770c5c4b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T18:24:40Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T18:24:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): bump next from 16.3.3 to 16.3.6 (#190)\n\nBumps [next](https://github.com/vercel/next.js) from 16.3.3 to 16.3.6.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/releases\">next''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v16.3.6</h2>\n<p>This release contains a security fix for <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/security/advisories/GHSA-vcvr-r3jv-pc5j\">GHSA-vcvr-r3jv-pc5j:\nRemote Code Execution in next/og ImageResponse</a></p>\n<h2>v16.3.5</h2>\n<p>The following bug fixes have been backported. It does not include all\npending features/changes on canary.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>next/image: Skip 0-byte entries when initializing disk LRU cache (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/98185\">#98185</a>)</li>\n<li>next/image: Reject empty images when reading/writing to the disk\ncache (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/98186\">#98186</a>)</li>\n<li>Emit whole-app server NFTs when <code>output: ''standalone''</code> is\nused with an adapter (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/98167\">#98167</a>)</li>\n<li>Add CSP nonce to script tags of loading and template files (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/98403\">#98403</a>)</li>\n<li>Fix <code>use cache</code> prerender signal retention (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/98448\">#98448</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v16.3.4</h2>\n<p>Follow-up release to <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/releases/tag/v16.3.3\">v16.3.3</a>\nre-enabling AVIF Image Optimization (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/97949\">#97949</a>).</p>\n<p>The following bug fixes have been backported. It does\n<strong>not</strong> include all pending features/changes on canary.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>testmode: Fix infinite recursion in testmode passthrough fetch (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/97691\">#97691</a>)</li>\n<li>Fix build error when aliasing typescript to\n<code>@​typescript/typescript6</code> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/97997\">#97997</a>)</li>\n<li>Fix unset crossOrigin in Turbopack manifests (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/97930\">#97930</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Credits</h3>\n<p>Huge thanks to <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/eps1lon\"><code>@​eps1lon</code></a>, <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/mischnic\"><code>@​mischnic</code></a>, and <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/timneutkens\"><code>@​timneutkens</code></a> for\nhelping!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/commit/a758ffcf501f6f1ddb03175bd1033508424c261e\"><code>a758ffc</code></a>\nv16.3.6</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/commit/868fad38690d72088868f299fa2bef339b26838e\"><code>868fad3</code></a>\n[active-lts] Harden next/og SVG serialization</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/commit/8c81cbb30a7f667ed74806d984f8117ee97f4665\"><code>8c81cbb</code></a>\n[lts-active] test: remove unsupported deployment ID builder cases (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/98821\">#98821</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/commit/ca2c75eb7f8d9dd012a8bb83c06132149fe221f9\"><code>ca2c75e</code></a>\nv16.3.5</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/commit/14fb290de65077e9f1e22ef56d8de6cc1e63d436\"><code>14fb290</code></a>\n[backport] Fix use cache prerender signal retention (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/98448\">#98448</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/commit/2b1f28dbe1de344807ec0946a85171bc890a6047\"><code>2b1f28d</code></a>\n[16.3.x] Add CSP nonce to script tags of loading and template files (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/98403\">#98403</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/commit/4b56cee3f01d3b249edcd798b51895d5126a4170\"><code>4b56cee</code></a>\n[16.3.x] Backport docs fixes (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/98317\">#98317</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/commit/5568a02a7d47f9cb088e58350f2c2e68d9e93a00\"><code>5568a02</code></a>\n[backport] docs: local development: Rewrite docker section, add Windows\nDev D...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/commit/93249ab2144132abfd4a8d611dad5b5978107ee2\"><code>93249ab</code></a>\n[16.3.X] Emit whole-app server NFTs when <code>output:\n''standalone''</code> is used with ...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/commit/6549fd7c4e15a8883b0ad1c2ef67dec287a44f12\"><code>6549fd7</code></a>\n[16.3.x] next/image: reject empty image on read/write to disk cache (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/98186\">#98186</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/compare/v16.3.3...v16.3.6\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n[![Dependabot compatibility\nscore](https://dependabot-badges.githubapp.com/badges/compatibility_score?dependency-name=next&package-manager=npm_and_yarn&previous-version=16.3.3&new-version=16.3.6)](https://docs.github.com/en/github/managing-security-vulnerabilities/about-dependabot-security-updates#about-compatibility-scores)\n\nDependabot will resolve any conflicts with this PR as long as you don''t\nalter it yourself. You can also trigger a rebase manually by commenting\n`@dependabot rebase`.\n\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-start)\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-end)\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Dependabot commands and options</summary>\n