s://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/100465780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hautest/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hautest/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hautest/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hautest/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hautest","id":100465780,"login":"hautest","node_id":"U_kgDOBfz8dA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hautest/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hautest/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hautest/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hautest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hautest/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hautest","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rollipop-dev/rollipop/commits/07ec1d35af34ad2992a40da3f9c99fd7a857b1ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T06:17:09Z","email":"dos07008@naver.com","name":"hautest"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T06:17:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: pass context when loading an explicit config file (#186)\n\nFixes #185 \n\n## Summary\n\nLoading a function-based configuration with `--config` currently calls\nit without context. A configuration that destructures `defaultConfig` or\n`command` therefore fails, even though automatic discovery of the same\nfile works.\n\nPass `commonOptions` to the explicit-file branch of `c12.loadConfig()`.\nThis provides the same context and `rcFile: false` setting as automatic\ndiscovery.\n\n[Minimal\nreproduction](https://github.com/hautest/rollipop-config-context-repro)\n\n## Regression coverage\n\n- Verify that automatic discovery, relative paths, and absolute paths\npass both `command` and `defaultConfig` to a configuration function.\n- Cover explicitly selected async functions and object configurations,\nand preserve rejection of missing configuration files.\n\nThe tests load temporary configuration files through the real `c12`\nloader. React Native default configuration setup is mocked.\n\n## Validation\n\n- [x] `yarn workspace rollipop test\nsrc/config/__tests__/load-config.spec.ts` (13 passed). With the fix\nreverted, the relative, absolute, and async cases fail with `TypeError:\nCannot destructure property ''command'' of ''undefined'' as it is\nundefined.`\n- [x] `yarn build:all`\n- [x] `yarn lint`\n- [x] `yarn typecheck:all`\n- [x] `yarn test:all`\n- [x] In the reproduction repository, the locally built CLI starts\nsuccessfully with and without `--config ./rollipop.config.mjs`. The\npublished `1.0.0-alpha.29` still fails with the reported error.","tree":{"sha":"ec77fb74734fde1bd71906c09a1b528172c61630","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rollipop-dev/rollipop/git/trees/ec77fb74734fde1bd71906c09a1b528172c61630"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rollipop-dev/rollipop/git/commits/07ec1d35af34ad2992a40da3f9c99fd7a857b1ff","verification":{"payload":"tree ec77fb74734fde1bd71906c09a1b528172c61630\nparent 5eb1455da0f2ec85d8798ad73bc561408afa5617\nauthor hautest <dos07008@naver.com> 1790576229 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790576229 +0900\n\nfix: pass context when loading an explicit config file (#186)\n\nFixes #185 \n\n## Summary\n\nLoading a function-based configuration with `--config` currently calls\nit without context. A configuration that destructures `defaultConfig` or\n`command` therefore fails, even though automatic discovery of the same\nfile works.\n\nPass `commonOptions` to the explicit-file branch of `c12.loadConfig()`.\nThis provides the same context and `rcFile: false` setting as automatic\ndiscovery.\n\n[Minimal\nreproduction](https://github.com/hautest/rollipop-config-context-repro)\n\n## Regression coverage\n\n- Verify that automatic discovery, relative paths, and absolute paths\npass both `command` and `defaultConfig` to a configuration function.\n- Cover explicitly selected async functions and object configurations,\nand preserve rejection of missing configuration files.\n\nThe tests load temporary configuration files through the real `c12`\nloader. React Native default configuration setup is mocked.\n\n## Validation\n\n- [x] `yarn workspace rollipop test\nsrc/config/__tests__/load-config.spec.ts` (13 passed). With the fix\nreverted, the relative, absolute, and async cases fail with `TypeError:\nCannot destructure property ''command'' of ''undefined'' as it is\nundefined.`\n- [x] `yarn build:all`\n- [x] `yarn lint`\n- [x] `yarn typecheck:all`\n- [x] `yarn test:all`\n- [x] In the reproduction repository, the locally built CLI starts\nsuccessfully with and without `--config ./rollipop.config.mjs`. The\npublished `1.0.0-alpha.29` still fails with the reported error.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqugZlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAeJgQADVvJdUubWmTIgX5qmf8Hixl\ng/Cejx+HgMplp6gMPCuc6mkOcCzYlz2Si7h0Av1rkZmFRROFHn9WAjZiesbX5a+d\nMU4fi0+N52+x62rQLwWuNhtcNNe5c+4KeB5avMm2lvXiuASiwUJsZZ7I/Gfd6c45\nWWfJ5B4OkcjXor2cr7XzaA2Pw8GcbBvktYZpp+YVMBfMaLYdfsj9LMzNvNWD1npO\nbQT6d3Td0MSimx+oPcpCd2i20ECENiygCpO07a6XHH/ynRdVjcUe5xuLNuz9B+Zt\n3Pf9B0JIhBqFYoKWe8ZJhTn/8HTFVNwUMeHdK/nchCI4oHnDGJ8vz/zXYn/tlEhb\nSPxxDhloNhmmeH0ZCI0fDGqxtezyX4zPo6rhK8nAiqH377ue5aZHzxXB7H0ke+N5\nUvcLQ84WobmwDARYTVg8+N3f5IkikhYcfTUCDrdLrOwA+Lzz2Ma/2rjHqDJkVIOe\nabAChuPExR51U0yJ/xbNN4S4XFSFDoQxyBMKt4cfAsXHln7QpfWiGZo4dbmAVDeP\nR5G++RoryjtNccssO17noR0ZIyQ1cetcGMRPFozh1Tlz7jTRjQsuuJg05rfwBh3W\nTQSsq1HmyLL02PEr8Xp2VZf1EWUqFh9blCDv3f5e3nDRtwBIFFw43NnlMYYe16Oj\nVkdzSTulcv6QfvpJ5mrv\n=d0FM\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T06:17:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/