"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rollipop-dev/rollipop/commits/bbf16e60dac2f5468dfdfc29869cbba31d8a5cab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T17:26:03Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T17:26:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): bump fastify from 5.10.0 to 5.12.1 (#170)\n\nBumps [fastify](https://github.com/fastify/fastify) from 5.10.0 to\n5.12.1.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/fastify/fastify/releases\">fastify''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v5.12.1</h2>\n<h2>⚠️  Security release</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix for <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/fastify/fastify/security/advisories/GHSA-w2qp-rph6-63g4\">https://github.com/fastify/fastify/security/advisories/GHSA-w2qp-rph6-63g4</a></li>\n<li>Fix for <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/fastify/fastify/security/advisories/GHSA-3m5p-2c4r-xxw2\">https://github.com/fastify/fastify/security/advisories/GHSA-3m5p-2c4r-xxw2</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>What''s Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[Backport 5.x] test: fix reply.mediaType by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/github-actions\"><code>@​github-actions</code></a>[bot]\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/fastify/fastify/pull/6950\">fastify/fastify#6950</a></li>\n<li>[Backport 5.x] ci: allow backport in pr title by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/github-actions\"><code>@​github-actions</code></a>[bot]\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/fastify/fastify/pull/6952\">fastify/fastify#6952</a></li>\n<li>[Backport 5.x] fix: run preClose hook exactly once per declaring\ninstance by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/github-actions\"><code>@​github-actions</code></a>[bot]\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/fastify/fastify/pull/6954\">fastify/fastify#6954</a></li>\n<li>[Backport 5.x] fix: report canonical route url for hidden prefix\nslash route by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/github-actions\"><code>@​github-actions</code></a>[bot]\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/fastify/fastify/pull/6961\">fastify/fastify#6961</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/fastify/fastify/compare/v5.12.0...v5.12.1\">https://github.com/fastify/fastify/compare/v5.12.0...v5.12.1</a></p>\n<h2>v5.12.0</h2>\n<h2>What''s Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>chore(sponsor): add testmu ai by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Eomm\"><code>@​Eomm</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/fastify/fastify/pull/6922\">fastify/fastify#6922</a></li>\n<li>docs: add per-route logging for Google Cloud Functions by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/slegarraga\"><code>@​slegarraga</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/fastify/fastify/pull/6907\">fastify/fastify#6907</a></li>\n<li>test: remove <code>@​sinonjs/fake-timers</code> by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/climba03003\"><code>@​climba03003</code></a> in\n<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/fastify/fastify/pull/6934\">fastify/fastify#6934</a></li>\n<li>[Backport 5.x] fix: remove raw response headers by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/github-actions\"><code>@​github-actions</code></a>[bot]\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/fastify/fastify/pull/6939\">fastify/fastify#6939</a></li>\n<li>[Backport 5.x] test: use process-warning spyWarning for testing by\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/github-actions\"><code>@​github-actions</code></a>[bot]\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/fastify/fastify/pull/6945\">fastify/fastify#6945</a></li>\n<li>[Backport 5.x] feat: add <code>Reply.prototype.mediaType</code> by\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/github-actions\"><code>@​github-actions</code></a>[bot]\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/fastify/fastify/pull/6946\">fastify/fastify#6946</a></li>\n<li>[Backport 5.x] fix(content-type): return <code>undefined</code> for\ninval