https://github.com/spokodev\"><code>@​spokodev</code></a>)</li>\n<li>fix: preserve whitespace before a <code>*</code> namespace in\nattribute selectors (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/postcss/postcss-selector-parser/pull/325\">#325</a>\nby <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/spokodev\"><code>@​spokodev</code></a>)</li>\n<li>fix: TypeError on unclosed <code>[</code>, <code>(</code> and\ntrailing <code>|</code> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/postcss/postcss-selector-parser/pull/330\">#330</a>\nby <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/theRizwan\"><code>@​theRizwan</code></a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>7.1.4</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>fix: tolerate non-node children when serializing selectors</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>7.1.3</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Improve fix CVE-2026-9358 (NVD) /\nSNYK-JS-POSTCSSSELECTORPARSER-16873882 (clone/walk)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>7.1.2</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-w9m9-85wc-3x92\">CVE-2026-9358</a>\n(NVD) / SNYK-JS-POSTCSSSELECTORPARSER-16873882 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/postcss/postcss-selector-parser/pull/316\">#316</a>\nby <a href=\"https://github.com/MoOx\"><code>@​MoOx</code></a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/postcss/postcss-selector-parser/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">postcss-selector-parser''s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>7.1.5 - 2026-08-07</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>fix: don''t treat a non-prefix token before <code>|</code> as a\nnamespace (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/postcss/postcss-selector-parser/pull/324\">#324</a>\nby <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/spokodev\"><code>@​spokodev</code></a>)</li>\n<li>fix: preserve whitespace before a <code>*</code> namespace in\nattribute selectors (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/postcss/postcss-selector-parser/pull/325\">#325</a>\nby <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/spokodev\"><code>@​spokodev</code></a>)</li>\n<li>fix: TypeError on unclosed <code>[</code>, <code>(</code> and\ntrailing <code>|</code> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/postcss/postcss-selector-parser/pull/330\">#330</a>\nby <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/theRizwan\"><code>@​theRizwan</code></a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>7.1.4 - 2026-06-11</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>fix: tolerate non-node children when serializing selectors</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>7.1.3 - 2026-06-11</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Improve fix CVE-2026-9358 (NVD) /\nSNYK-JS-POSTCSSSELECTORPARSER-16873882 (clone/walk)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>7.1.2 - 2026-06-09</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-w9m9-85wc-3x92\">CVE-2026-9358</a>\n(NVD) / SNYK-JS-POSTCSSSELECTORPARSER-16873882 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/postcss/postcss-selector-parser/pull/316\">#316</a>\nby <a href=\"https://github.com/MoOx\"><code>@​MoOx</code></a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/postcss/postcss-selector-parser/commit/e33e9bca3e9afd7ba07ffaad4fe0868d421dfb34\"><code>e33e9bc</code></a>\n7.1.5</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/postcss/postcss-selector-parser/commit/6f4e6c1def46c2591f6874d2cd39a1aec767d5bb\"><code>6f4e6c1</code></a>\nfix: TypeError on unclosed <code>[</code>, <code>(</code> and trailing\n<code>|</code> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/postcss/postcss-selector-parser/issues/330\">#330</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/postcss/postcss-selector-parser/commit/4d8437ffc4a510606b78f0bc762620fcff2b1d7c\"><code>4d8437f</code></a>\nfix: preserve whitespace before a <code>*</code> namespace in attribute\nselectors (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/postcss/postcss-selector-parser/issues/325\">#325</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/postcss/postcss-selector-parser/commit/e2f902954c83f6580eaacdf174232882e293cd5a\"><code>e2f9029</code></a>\nfix: don''t treat a non-prefix token before <code>|</code> as a namespace\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/postcss/postcss-selector-parser/issues/324\">#324</a>)</li>\n