/api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rollipop-dev/rollipop/commits/3ee03397058d5bdbd8bca5c39886820c9b894beb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T01:47:28Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T01:47:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): bump nanoid from 3.3.11 to 3.3.17 (#161)\n\nBumps [nanoid](https://github.com/ai/nanoid) from 3.3.11 to 3.3.17.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ai/nanoid/releases\">nanoid''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>3.3.17</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed infinite loop on zero size.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>3.3.16</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed infinite loop on negative size (by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/greymoth-jp\"><code>@​greymoth-jp</code></a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>3.3.15</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed npm provenance error.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>3.3.14</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed random pool corruption on big ID sizes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>3.3.13</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Reduced npm package size.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>3.3.12</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed breaking Nano ID by requesting big ID.</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ai/nanoid/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">nanoid''s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>3.3.17</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed infinite loop on zero size.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>3.3.16</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed infinite loop on negative size (by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/greymoth-jp\"><code>@​greymoth-jp</code></a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>3.3.15</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed npm provenance error.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>3.3.14</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed random pool corruption on big ID sizes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>3.3.13</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Reduced npm package size.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>3.3.12</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed breaking Nano ID by requesting big ID.</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ai/nanoid/commit/73d67168136b36fd3b644159b0cff149da4905d9\"><code>73d6716</code></a>\nRelease 3.3.17 version</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ai/nanoid/commit/f9d13f150847d117877adee3460a46eceb0cf49b\"><code>f9d13f1</code></a>\nSync 0 size behaviour with PostCSS 5</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ai/nanoid/commit/9760e112757cf7d46a79abd7a133bc4958757bb8\"><code>9760e11</code></a>\nRelease 3.3.16 version</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ai/nanoid/commit/e835c9b71eab832bc6106944bdd26ea96cf2c66d\"><code>e835c9b</code></a>\nfix(non-secure): clamp negative size to prevent infinite loop (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/ai/nanoid/issues/601\">#601</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ai/nanoid/commit/96dd086eb24396a275fa93ee78d73b2fece35809\"><code>96dd086</code></a>\nUpdate CI action</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ai/nanoid/commit/ba0bc3b6b95a7e8fb97efa248306e0512b340ace\"><code>ba0bc3b</code></a>\nDo not create latest release for v3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ai/nanoid/commit/6819724a0ebe3d1980de66980f6bc5df4bf6a41f\"><code>6819724</code></a>\nRelease 3.3.15 version</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ai/nanoid/commit/fb0b1371949181c827481202444ec6a762d592f6\"><code>fb0b137</code></a>\nFix tag for v3</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ai/nanoid/commit/e084bc94d7ce7dc41f0ba4a46573b2990debad1c\"><code>e084bc9</code></a>\nBack-port new release system and fix pre-commit hook</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ai/nanoid/commit/7e32945f904bf213bb396b317d41c3ef349e40ca\"><code>7e32945</code></a>\nRelease 3.3.14 version</li