l.com","name":"bhushanpoojary@gmail.com"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-05T18:36:44Z","email":"bhushanpoojary@gmail.com","name":"bhushanpoojary@gmail.com"},"message":"Add Notification Center with toast UI and configurable actions\n\nfeat: Add Notification Center with toast UI and configurable actions\n\nImplemented a complete notification system for FinDesktop:\n\nCore System:\n- Created NotificationCenter service with show/subscribe/history methods\n- Defined notification types (info, success, warning, error)\n- Added notification action model for interactive buttons\n\nUI Components:\n- Built NotificationTray with slide-in toast animations\n- Positioned toasts in bottom-right corner with stacking\n- Styled type variants with color-coded borders\n- Auto-dismiss after 5s for simple notifications\n- Manual dismiss via close button\n\nConfiguration:\n- Added NotificationActionHandler type to FinDesktopConfig\n- Implemented default action handlers (DISMISS, VIEW_DETAILS)\n- Created extension point for custom action handlers\n- Integrated with desktop event bus (NOTIFICATION_ACTION_CLICKED)\n\nIntegration:\n- Added NotificationTray to main.tsx root level\n- Added test button to InstrumentSourceApp\n- Integrated with Fdc3DemoLayout\n- Created demo page and examples\n\nFiles Added:\n- src/core/notifications/NotificationTypes.ts\n- src/core/notifications/NotificationCenter.ts\n- src/ui/NotificationTray.tsx\n- src/ui/NotificationTray.css\n- src/extensions/NotificationActions.config.ts\n- Documentation and examples","tree":{"sha":"567b418cae6412addfbd4c62c2beaf086b4f2bea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bhushanpoojary/fin-desktop/git/trees/567b418cae6412addfbd4c62c2beaf086b4f2bea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bhushanpoojary/fin-desktop/git/commits/28b06c45d4147f39b2a8232fd967809f0b678b8f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserc