","html_url":"https://github.com/bhushanpoojary","id":64708832,"login":"bhushanpoojary","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzA4ODMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bhushanpoojary/fin-desktop/commits/ca8e160842c87d1546e19762399a1b8b49bcc29f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-05T17:51:10Z","email":"bhushanpoojary@gmail.com","name":"bhushanpoojary@gmail.com"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-05T17:51:10Z","email":"bhushanpoojary@gmail.com","name":"bhushanpoojary@gmail.com"},"message":"add demo authentication layer with login screen\n\nfeat: add demo authentication layer with login screen\n\n- Created LoginScreen component with gradient UI and form validation\n- Enhanced DefaultAuthProvider with localStorage session persistence\n- Added onAuthChanged callback support for reactive auth state\n- Integrated auth flow into AppShell (check session → login → workspace)\n- Updated CustomAuthProvider with reactive auth callbacks\n- Added 1.5s minimum splash screen display before login\n- Auth provider resolved from finDesktopConfig.authProvider with fallback to DefaultAuthProvider\n- Session automatically restored on page refresh\n\n⚠️ Note: DefaultAuthProvider is demo-only and accepts any non-empty credentials","tree":{"sha":"81bdd99c3a90a5ab2d5373759b7ef75d84500791","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bhushanpoojary/fin-desktop/git/trees/81bdd99c3a90a5ab2d5373759b7ef75d84500791"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bhushanpoojary/fin-desktop/git/commits/ca8e160842c