","name":"bhushanpoojary@gmail.com"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-05T17:06:12Z","email":"bhushanpoojary@gmail.com","name":"bhushanpoojary@gmail.com"},"message":"feat: Add splash screen with AppShell initialization flow\n\nfeat: Add splash screen with AppShell initialization flow\n\nImplement customizable splash screen and app shell to manage initialization:\n\n- Add SplashScreen component with branded loading UI\n  - Full-screen overlay with fade-in/fade-out animations\n  - Displays logo, product name, tagline, and loading status\n  - Uses IProductBranding for customizable branding\n  - Responsive design with spinner animation\n\n- Add AppShell component to orchestrate app lifecycle\n  - Parallel initialization of layout manager and desktop API\n  - Dynamic status text updates during loading phases\n  - Minimum 2-second display time for splash visibility\n  - Smooth transition to WorkspaceShell after init\n  - Error handling with reload capability\n  - Comprehensive console logging for debugging\n\n- Update main.tsx to use AppShell as default entry point\n- Update workspaceWindow.cjs to load without parameters\n- Add comprehensive documentation (README, QUICK_START, examples)\n\nThe splash screen displays for ~2 seconds during initialization, then\nsmoothly transitions to the main workspace. Customers can customize viafeat: Add splash screen with AppShell initialization flow\n\nImplement customizable splash screen and app shell to manage initialization:\n\n- Add SplashScreen component with branded loading UI\n  - Full-screen overlay with fade-in/fade-out animations\n  - Displays logo, product name, tagline, and loading status\n  - Uses IProductBranding for customizable branding\n  - Responsive design with spinner animation\n\n- Add AppShell component to orchestrate app lifecycle\n  - Parallel initialization of layout manager and desktop API\n  - Dynamic status text updates during loading phases\n  - Minimum 2-second display time for splash visibility\n  - Smooth transition to WorkspaceShell after init\n  - Error handling with reload capability\n  - Comprehensive console logging for debugging\n\n- Update main.tsx to use AppShell as default entry point\n- Update workspaceWindow.cjs to load without parameters\n- Add comprehensive documentation (README, QUICK_START, examples)\n\nThe splash screen displays for ~2 seconds during initialization, then\nsmoothly transitions to the main workspace. Customers can customize via\nIProductBranding or replace the splash component entirely.\nIProductBranding or replace the splash component entirely.","tree":{"sha":"56bd301eddc2768dde292104fbbe62c4096cbbe3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bhushanpoojary/fin-desktop/git/trees/56bd301eddc2768dde292104fbbe62c4096cbbe3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bhushanpoojary/fin-desktop/git/commits/9cc9d68686fe5923eea0ec67c051cfacf9cbb41f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64708832?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bhushanpoojary","id":64708832,"login":"bhushanpoojary","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzA4ODMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary","user_view_type