mail.com","name":"bhushanpoojary@gmail.com"},"message":"feat: implement TrayManager with system tray integration\n\nfeat: implement TrayManager with system tray integration\n\n- Add SimpleTrayManager for Electron main process with tray icon support\n- Implement minimize to tray functionality with window hide/restore\n- Add context menu with \"Open\", \"Settings\", and \"Exit\" actions\n- Integrate tray IPC handlers for renderer process control\n- Add \"Minimize to Tray\" button to WorkspaceShell UI\n- Extend DesktopApi types with tray functionality\n- Create 16x16 orange tray icon for Windows system tray\n- Support double-click tray icon to restore window\n- Prevent app quit on window close, minimize to tray instead\n- Add comprehensive documentation and test guide\n\nFiles added:\n- electron/simpleTrayManager.cjs - CommonJS tray manager implementation\n- src/desktop/TrayManager.ts - Full TypeScript implementation\n- src/desktop/DesktopEventBus.ts - Event bus for desktop events\n- src/desktop/types.ts - TypeScript type definitions\n- src/desktop/README.md - Comprehensive documentation\n- TRAY_TEST_GUIDE.md - Testing instructions\n- public/icons/tray-icon.png - System tray icon asset\n\nFiles modified:\n- electron/main.cjs - Integrate TrayManager and IPC handlers\n- electron/preload.cjs - Expose tray API to renderer\n- src/workspace/WorkspaceShell.tsx - Add minimize button\n- src/shared/desktopApi.ts - Add tray API types\n- src/core/interfaces/IProductBranding.ts - Add tray branding methods\n- src/core/defaults/DefaultBranding.ts - Implement tray methods","tree":{"sha":"3ceef2b8b4748266b16535cc509ff4149890fd63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bhushanpoojary/fin-desktop/git/trees/3ceef2b8b4748266b16535cc509ff4149890fd63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bhushanpoojary/fin-desktop/git/commits/35c45350c06e41c0f0bafd14e6306e6f2c93c65e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_ur