ists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bhushanpoojary","id":64708832,"login":"bhushanpoojary","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzA4ODMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bhushanpoojary/fin-desktop/commits/593e5d549f1872e17242795f1d3050e1e1797585/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-05T13:17:35Z","email":"bhushanpoojary@gmail.com","name":"bhushanpoojary@gmail.com"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-05T13:17:35Z","email":"bhushanpoojary@gmail.com","name":"bhushanpoojary@gmail.com"},"message":"implement Core vs Customer Layer architecture for safe customization\n\nfeat: implement Core vs Customer Layer architecture for safe customization\n\nImplement comprehensive separation between core FinDesktop code and customer\ncustomizations to enable safe git pulls without breaking user modifications.\n\nCore Layer (src/core/):\n- Add 5 stable public interfaces (IAuthProvider, INotificationProvider,\n  IThemeProvider, IChannelProvider, IProductBranding)\n- Add 5 core components (WindowManager, LayoutManager, NotificationCenter,\n  ThemeEngine, AuthFramework)\n- Add 6 default implementations under src/core/defaults/\n- Add default.config.ts for easy wiring\n\nCustomer Layer (src/extensions/):\n- Add safe customization zone with example implementations\n- Add CustomBranding, CustomAuthProvider, CustomThemeProvider\n- Add clear \"safe to edit\" comments and guidelines\n\nConfiguration (src/config/):\n- Add FinDesktopConfig.ts with provider wiring pattern\n- Add IConfigProvider and ConfigProviderFactory\n- Add DemoConfigProvider for testing\n\nDocumentation:\n- Add ARCHITECTURE.md (600+ lines) with complete architecture guide\n- Add ARCHITECTURE_DIAGRAMS.md with 10+ visual diagrams\n- Add GIT_STRATEGY.md with 4 workflow strategies\n- Add IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md documenting all changes\n- Add TODO_NPM_PACKAGE.md for future NPM migration roadmap\n- Add QUICK_START.md for 5-minute getting started\n- Add README_DOCS.md as documentation index\n\nBenefits:\n- Core updates via git pull won''t overwrite customizations\n- Clear separation between framework and user code\n- Stable public contracts with breaking change guarantees\n- Ready for future NPM package migration\n- Comprehensive documentation (4000+ lines across 6 docs)\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: None - this is purely additive architecture","tree":{"sha":"8721e4491a14fb30baa931a3981878e820fd2ba7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bhushanpoojary/fin-desktop/git/trees/8721e4491a14fb30baa931a3981878e820fd2ba7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bhushanpoojary/fin-desktop/git/commits/593e5d549f1872e17242795f1d3050e1e1797585","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64708832?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bhushanpoojary","id":64708832,"login":"bhushanpoojary","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzA4ODMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bhushanpoojary/repos","site_adm