users/kaneticmomentum-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kaneticmomentum-dev","id":226842043,"login":"kaneticmomentum-dev","node_id":"U_kgDODYVVuw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaneticmomentum-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaneticmomentum-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaneticmomentum-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaneticmomentum-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaneticmomentum-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaneticmomentum-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bhushanpoojary/fin-desktop/commits/89535b77875032480d72a013d0006a70395f4be4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-04T19:51:19Z","email":"kaneticmomentum-dev@outlook.com","name":"bhushanpoojary@gmail.com"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-04T19:51:19Z","email":"kaneticmomentum-dev@outlook.com","name":"bhushanpoojary@gmail.com"},"message":"feat: Add minimal FDC3 layer with instrument selection context sharing\n\nImplement Phase 1 of FDC3-like functionality for cross-window instrument\ncontext broadcasting with modern, professional UI.\n\nCore FDC3 Infrastructure:\n- Add types.ts with SelectedInstrumentContext, Fdc3EventType, and Fdc3Event\n- Implement Fdc3Bus.ts with publish/subscribe using Electron IPC bridge\n- Create Fdc3Context.tsx with React Provider, useFdc3Bus, and useSelectedInstrument hooks\n- Integrate with existing Electron bus.cjs for cross-window communication\n\nDemo Applications:\n- InstrumentSourceApp: Publisher with clickable instrument list (AAPL, MSFT, GOOG, TSLA, JPM, BAC)\n- InstrumentTargetApp: Subscriber displaying selected instrument with real-time updates\n- Fdc3EventsLogScreen: Event log showing all broadcasts with timestamps\n\nUI/UX Improvements:\n- Modern gradient headers (purple, pink, blue themes)\n- Card-based layouts with hover effects and animations\n- Selected state indicators and pulse animations\n- Professional typography and spacing\n- Responsive empty states with icons\n- Clear log functionality\n\nTechnical Details:\n- All TypeScript strict mode compliant with explicit types\n- Cross-window communication via Electron IPC (desktopApi)\n- Integrated with existing useLogger system\n- Fixed useEffect dependency issues preventing event flooding\n- Registered apps in demo-apps.json and AppHost.tsx\n- Wrapped app with Fdc3Provider in main.tsx\n\nArchitecture designed for future extensions:\n- Multiple context types (trade, order, chart, news)\n- Intent system (raiseIntent, addIntentListener)\n- Channel concepts (user channels, app channels)\n- Full FDC3 2.0+ compliance","tree":{"sha":"c509d94d518760efc1fb41a96489bc184c9ecc38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bhushanpoojary/fin-desktop/git/trees/c509d94d518760efc1fb41a96489bc184c9ecc38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bhushanpoojary/fin-desktop/git/commits/89535b77875032480d72a013d0006a70395f4be4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226842043?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaneticmomentum-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaneticmomentum-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaneticmomentum-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaneticmomentum-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kaneticmomentum-dev","id":226842043,"login":"kaneticmomentum-dev","node_id":"U_kgDODYVVuw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaneticmomentum-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaneticmomentum-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaneticmomentum-dev/repos","site_admin":