: Add global logging system with LogsScreen UI\n\nImplement comprehensive logging infrastructure for Fin Desktop:\n\n- Add logging types (LogLevel, LogEntry) with strict TypeScript support\n- Create LogStoreContext with React context for global log management\n  - Maintains max 1000 log entries with auto-rotation\n  - Provides addLog() and clear() methods\n- Add useLogger hook with convenience methods (debug, info, warn, error)\n- Implement LogsScreen component with:\n  - Real-time log display with auto-scroll\n  - Filtering by level (debug/info/warn/error)\n  - Source filtering dropdown\n  - Text search across messages and details\n  - Expandable rows for JSON details\n  - Color-coded log levels\n- Wire LogStoreProvider at app root in main.tsx\n- Add logging to Launcher (mount, catalog load, app launches)\n- Add logging to OrderTicketApp (validation errors, trade execution)\n- Add Logs screen toggle button to workspace UI\n\nAll logs from any component now visible in centralized LogsScreen.","tree":{"sha":"3b83f24b648a4edbf9fdec11dfe4b8ccdcd98853","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bhushanpoojary/fin-desktop/git/trees/3b83f24b648a4edbf9fdec11dfe4b8ccdcd98853"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bhushanpoojary/fin-desktop/git/commits/9eced6d404d3971f36330c6e9957cdea3c3fd4b3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226842043?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaneticmomentum-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaneticmomentum-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaneticmomentum-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaneticmomentum-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kaneticmomentum-dev","id":226842043,"login":"kaneticmomentum-dev","node_id":"U_kgDODYVVuw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/user