:39:54Z","email":"543665+nerdpudding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nerdpudding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-04T17:39:54Z","email":"543665+nerdpudding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nerdpudding"},"message":"Refactor prompt handling and configuration loading\n\n- Added a new prompt loader to manage prompt templates from a YAML configuration file.\n- Introduced a configuration endpoint to fetch default settings and available templates for the frontend.\n- Updated the frontend to support template selection and display corresponding descriptions.\n- Modified the Ollama client to utilize the new prompt loader for generating presentations based on selected templates.\n- Enhanced the daily log with detailed task tracking for prompt configuration refactor.\n- Updated requirements to include PyYAML for YAML parsing.","tree":{"sha":"560c00799b4f4978881f7d4ae61e40ff23a8d4af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xp3s/pptx_poc/git/trees/560c00799b4f4978881f7d4ae61e40ff23a8d4af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xp3s/pptx_poc/git/commits/9904b561b0bb06c1b45aea9e6f89ecd92aa9ed98","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xp3s/pptx_poc/commit/9904b561b0bb06c1b45aea9e6f89ecd92aa9ed98","node_id":"C_kwDOQiq8UNoAKDk5MDRiNTYxYjBiYjA2YzFiNDVhZWE5ZTZmODllY2Q5MmFhOWVkOTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xp3s/pptx_poc/commit/fabbbe14d9f07dac7955a53962cc4c4d6b53bf43","sha":"fabbbe14d9f07dac7955a53962cc4c4d6b53bf43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xp3s/pptx_poc/commits/fabbbe14d9f07dac7955a53962cc4c4d6b53bf43"}],"sha":"9904b561b0bb06c1b45aea9e6f89ecd92aa9ed98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xp3s/pptx_poc/commits/9904b561b0bb06c1b45aea9e6f89ecd92aa9ed98"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xp3s/pptx_poc/commits/fabbbe14d9f07dac7955a53962cc4c4d6b53bf43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-04T17:14:02Z","email":"543665+nerdpudding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nerdpudding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-04T17:14:02Z","email":"543665+nerdpudding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nerdpudding"},"message":" Workaround num_ctx bug, add system prompt support\n\n  - Discovered num_ctx bug: model crashes/repeats with non-default values\n  - Workaround: disabled num_ctx in frontend and backend (uses modelfile default)\n  - Added system prompt textarea to main frontend settings\n  - Added system field to GenerateRequest model\n  - Documented bug in ollama_api_research.md (to investigate later)\n\n  Bug: ministral-3-14b-it-2512-q8-120k crashes or generates repetitions\n  when num_ctx differs from modelfile value (122880). Root cause unknown.","tree":{"sha":"f32ed23df96dad0e700682fdff634437b2877db9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xp3s/pptx_poc/git/trees/f32ed23df96dad0e700682fdff634437b2877db9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xp3s/pptx_poc/git/commits/fabbbe14d9f07dac7955a53962cc4c4d6b53bf43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xp3s/pptx_poc/commit/fabbbe14d9f07dac7955a53962cc4c4d6b53bf43","node_id":"C_kwDOQiq8UNoAKGZhYmJiZTE0ZDlmMDdkYWM3OTU1YTUzOTYyY2M0YzRkNmI1M2JmNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xp3s/pptx_poc/commit/0c03da7d0af40aea3b599baf536992b328955a22","sha":"0c03da7d0af40aea3b599baf536992b328955a22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xp3s/pptx_poc/commits/0c03da7d0af40aea3b599baf536992b328955a22"}],"sha":"fabbbe14d9f07dac7955a53962cc4c4d6b53bf43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xp3s/pptx_poc/commits/fabbbe14d9f07dac7955a53962cc4c4d6b53bf43"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xp3s/pptx_poc/commits/0c03da7d0af40aea3b599baf536992b328955a22/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-04T16:22:42Z","email":"543665+nerdpudding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nerdpudding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-04T16:22:42Z","email":"543665+nerdpudding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nerdpudding"},"message":"Add Ollama streaming integration and debug panel\n\n  - Add streaming endpoint (/api/v1/stream) with SSE support\n  - Create debug.html panel for LLM testing with live output\n  - Expose all Ollama parameters (temp, num_ctx, num_predict, top_k, top_p, etc)\n  - Add system prompt support for custom instructions\n  - Fix ollama_client.py: imports, constructor, format:\"json\"\n  - Add tenacity for retry logic\n  - Update nginx timeouts to 180s for long LLM requests\n  - Add Advanced Settings panel to main frontend\n  - Document Ollama API research in Sprint1/ollama_api_research.md\n\n  Tested: Streaming works, JSON response received (~3.7 t/s @ 14B model)","tree":{"sha":"c283de732407526841ccc785371fa788ba7e6299","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xp3s/pptx_poc/git/trees/c283de732407526841ccc785371fa788ba7e6299"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xp3s/pptx_poc/git/commits/0c03da7d0af40aea3b599baf536992b328955a22","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xp3s/pptx_poc/commit/0c03da7d0af40aea3b599baf536992b328955a22","node_id":"C_kwDOQiq8UNoAKDBjMDNkYTdkMGFmNDBhZWEzYjU5OWJhZjUzNjk5MmIzMjg5NTVhMjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xp3s/pptx_poc/commit/be5675098a8a384e58cd839fe67a397957d79024","sha":"be5675098a8a384e58cd839fe67a397957d79024","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xp3s/pptx_poc/commits/be5675098a8a384e58cd839fe67a397957d79024"}],"sha":"0c03da7d0af40aea3b599baf536992b328955a22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xp3s/pptx_poc/commits/0c03da7d0af40aea3b599baf536992b328955a22"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xp3s/pptx_poc/commits/be5675098a8a384e58cd839fe67a397957d79024/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-04T15:24:25Z","email":"543665+nerdpudding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nerdpudding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-04T15:24:25Z","email":"543665+nerdpudding@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nerdpudding"},"message":"Add Ollama client integration, frontend settings panel, and technical docs\n\n  Backend (orchestrator):\n  - Fix ollama_client.py: add HTTPException import, remove broken Depends()\n    from constructor, improve JSON cleaning with regex for markdown blocks\n  - Update config.py: correct model name (ministral-3-14b-it-2512-q8-120k),\n    add temperature (0.15) and num_ctx (122880) defaults, increase timeout to 120s\n  - Extend GenerateRequest model with optional temperature, num_ctx, slides params\n  - Update routes.py to log effective parameter values\n\n  Frontend:\n  - Add collapsible \"Advanced Settings\" panel with:\n    - Slides slider (3-10, default 5)\n    - Temperature slider (0.0-2.0, default 0.15)\n    - Context size dropdown (32K/64K/120K)\n  - Style settings panel for dark theme\n  - Wire up settings to API calls\n\n  Documentation:\n  - Add TECH_DOCUMENTATION.md for developers (architecture, SOLID, config\n    hierarchy, code patterns, security considerations, debugging tips)\n  - Update .env.example with new Ollama parameters\n\n  Progress: Sprint 1 now at 71% (58/82 tasks)\n  - Backend phase: 100% complete\n  - Ollama integration: ready for testing","tree":{"sha":"6542788196c27859f895a8cb32b83c1dad24e639","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xp3s/pptx_poc/git/trees/6542788196c27859f895a8cb32b83c1dad24e639"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xp3s/pptx_poc/git/commits/be5675098a8a384e58cd839fe67a397957d79024","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/xp3s/pptx_poc/commit/be5675098a8a384e58cd839fe67a397957d79024","node_id":"C_kwDOQiq8UNoAKGJlNTY3NTA5OGE4YTM4NGU1OGNkODM5ZmU2N2EzOTc5NTdkNzkwMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xp3s/pptx_poc/commit/808857c528