dress","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ClemOrc/poc-demo-mywealth-ui/commits/b83420738ed293626b440225c00e1e8ae8b38ce5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-08T15:56:58Z","email":"bot@github.com","name":"root"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-08T15:56:58Z","email":"bot@github.com","name":"root"},"message":"feat(CGIAIT-12): Add approve/decline context menu for pending agreements\n\n- Add AgreementActionMenu component with approve/decline actions\n- Add ConfirmationDialog component for action confirmation\n- Add Toast component for success/error notifications\n- Update AgreementTable to show context menu only for PENDING_APPROVAL status\n- Add UPDATE_AGREEMENT_STATUS mutation in GraphQL\n- Implement updateAgreementStatus resolver in mock backend\n- Update Dashboard with dynamic state management (no page reload)\n- Handle status updates: Approve -> ACTIVE, Decline -> EXPIRED\n- Remove agreement from list and update counter after successful action\n- Add proper error handling with toast notifications\n\nImplements CGIAIT-12 acceptance criteria:\n- AC1: Context menu visible only for PENDING_APPROVAL status\n- AC2: Menu shows Approve and Decline options\n- AC3: Confirmation modal before action\n- AC4: Backend status update via API\n- AC5: Dynamic UI update without page reload\n- AC6: Success/error toast notifications","tree":{"sha":"55c6c00221ffde0d83763a92c9e06245b6a0bba9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ClemOrc/poc-demo-mywealth-ui/git/trees/55c6c00221ffde0d83763a92c9e06245b6a0bba9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ClemOrc/poc-demo-mywealth-ui/git/commits/b83420738ed293626b440225c00e1e8ae8b38ce5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/148100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/invalid-email-address/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/use